      "value": "Our approach to this is a new static method - IsValid(object o). You can pass any object into this method and it will return True or False. For VRCPlayerApi, we're specifically checking to see if the player is still in the room. For all other objects, it will work the same as a null check for now, but can be extended in the future to check for special cases like this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
