      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: MonoBehaviour does not capture basic Unity builtin component types like MeshRenderer and such, it's only user defined types for the most part. It also doesn't capture asset types which may be destroyed at runtime such as RenderTexture.",
